{"id":"592164","name":"火腿肠丁炒饭","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"","cover":"images/592164/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冷饭","amount":"200g"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"20g"},{"name":"莴笋","amount":"20g"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"10g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜和莴笋切成丁。","img":"images/592164/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"火腿肠切成丁，葱切成葱花。","img":"images/592164/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪油溶化热以后，打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/592164/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撒入盐，把鸡蛋搅散。","img":"images/592164/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入三丁混炒。","img":"images/592164/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把菜炒香后。","img":"images/592164/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入冷饭。","img":"images/592164/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"饭和菜充分混合后，加入葱花翻炒香即可加入盐调味。","img":"images/592164/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/592164/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}